    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2j7ZPUQMScwM5cCavZFLOHHMTwatzQGCM4qH0OuAj-mWMnJ7wmRpYSd_57di3yWbDjO9WHvHI7Xf6SuNBc0w2ChGh0AtsXJHA-YY_22FGlNN_ruG2cMo6dxV0OCqNEOzIY4FcppG-LoZRUYK-_ctKaLssq_csOkxblq4Q557yPJGh1Sbhzp7bAmpNmywd/s2622/%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%A8%B9%E4%BB%94IMG_2219.tif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1967\" data-original-width=\"2622\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh2j7ZPUQMScwM5cCavZFLOHHMTwatzQGCM4qH0OuAj-mWMnJ7wmRpYSd_57di3yWbDjO9WHvHI7Xf6SuNBc0w2ChGh0AtsXJHA-YY_22FGlNN_ruG2cMo6dxV0OCqNEOzIY4FcppG-LoZRUYK-_ctKaLssq_csOkxblq4Q557yPJGh1Sbhzp7bAmpNmywd/w640-h480/%E5%B8%8C%E6%9C%9B%E7%9A%84%E6%A8%B9%E4%BB%94IMG_2219.tif\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品名稱</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">希望之樹</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品說明</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我國校仔五年仔ê時，學校美術課老師叫阮逐家畫希望之樹，若是有一欉ē-sái hē願ê樹仔，天使ē幫助你完成願望，我想beh做一个真正ê台灣人。</span></div><div><br /></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><div>#希望#台灣#獨立#自由</div><div><br /></div><div>我tī台灣出世</div><div><br /></div><div>我甘願死tī台灣</div><div><br /></div><div>我是一个「正港」ê台灣人</div></span></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作年代</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2024年6--月</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作形式</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">色鉛筆</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品寸尺</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">38x26cm</span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者簡介</span></b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廖文綺（A-Khí），11歲，蹛tī桃園龜山，讀大崗國小，我上愛看冊、畫圖kah tshit-thô。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a></span><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/s1424/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/w450-h640/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZ